isfile	(path: string) → boolean	Whether path is a readable file.
isfolder	(path: string) → boolean	Whether path is a directory.
delfile	(path: string)	Delete a file.
delfolder	(path: string)	Delete a directory and its contents.
makefolder	(path: string)	Create a directory (nested — parents created as needed).
listfiles	(path: string) → {string}	List all entries directly inside path.
loadfile	(path: string, chunkname: string?) → function|nil, string?	Compile a file's contents into a closure.
getcustomasset	(path: string) → string	Returns a rbxasset://-style URL for use as image/sound/etc.
setclipboard	(text: string)	Set OS clipboard contents. Aliases: setrbxclipboard, toclipboard
