run_on_actor	(actor: Instance, source: string, ...args)	Compile and run a script on target Actor's VM. Args are deep-marshaled cross-VM. Fires-and-forgets; errors propagate to caller. Aliases: runonactor
run_on_thread	(thread: thread, source: string, ...args)	Same as run_on_actor but takes a raw actor-mainthread pointer. Aliases: runonthread
